[{"id":2730024542,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6iuN5e","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected. I've also tested (re)setting color/constant arrays on multiple selected nodes at once and it works too. It also works with MSDF font rendering, although remember to increase the MSDF pixel range for high outline sizes in the Import dock as usual.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test_pr_104731.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19539210/test_pr_104731.zip)\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c9b3bd66-0a75-4358-ba7c-7ccbce81b02d)\r\n\r\n\r\nSome feedback:\r\n\r\n- When you first set a theme color/constant array override, it changes from Nil to an array of size 0, which looks a bit strange:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7c635246-ff42-4ee4-87b2-a34bdcb3e4a2)\r\n\r\nI think non-overridden items should be empty arrays instead, so that their value doesn't change as soon as you add an override. This is also more consistent with non-array constants which start at `0`.\r\n\r\n- There should be a node configuration warning when there's a mismatch between the number of outline/shadow colors and sizes/offsets, as values that don't have a matching will fall back to the default (transparent for color, `0` for size/offset), which is probably not intended by the user.\r\n- Changes to colors within constant arrays are not applied instantly, unlike change to non-array theme colors. You need to click outside the color picker for the change to apply, which slows down iteration.\r\n  - This may be a more general issue with the array property editors, I'm not sure.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104731#pullrequestreview-2730024542","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104731","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104731#pullrequestreview-2730024542"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104731"}},"submitted_at":"2025-03-31T17:43:28Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2731701113,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6i0nN5","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?u=2867ee7fcd920bc19b7d1cbf4b10264b9bbc9326&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/rece